      "seed": 215322168,
      "version": 814,
      "versionNonce": 878415160,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1751993174074,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Wow will not allow addons to\ninteract with an external web\nservice\n\n- Data is persisted to a .lua db\nusing SavedVariables in\ninterface/WTF folder\n",
      "fontSize": 56.898916528955205,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Wow will not allow addons to interact with an external web service\n\n- Data is persisted to a .lua db using SavedVariables in interface/WTF folder\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RNV0J35iyttMENlQGMIf_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1148.3095266777837,
      "y": 4505.730617900673,
      "width": 1884.2941038635145,
      "height": 785.0989770262549,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1282722360,
      "version": 1382,
      "versionNonce": 2035640888,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1751993192155,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Wow In-game Add-On\n- Addon has a lot of features e.g.: add,\nlist, remove entries, track number of\npeople logged\n\n- does not have any analytics /\nvisualizations\n",
      "fontSize": 78.5098977026255,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Wow In-game Add-On\n- Addon has a lot of features e.g.: add, list, remove entries, track number of people logged\n\n- does not have any analytics / visualizations\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YY_mqGjc6t2INap93-oZz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1970.1521463259746,
      "y": 4493.142690893327,
      "width": 1884.2941038635145,
      "height": 883.2363491545368,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b80",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1547816760,
      "version": 2009,
      "versionNonce": 1820321096,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1751993198175,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "With a web app we could do things like:\n- persist data and have longer-term safe\nstorage in case of wow-reinstall / person\nplaying on other computer\n\n- Could do rankings / hi score\nfunctionality\n\n",
      "fontSize": 78.5098977026255,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "With a web app we could do things like:\n- persist data and have longer-term safe storage in case of wow-reinstall / person playing on other computer\n\n- Could do rankings / hi score functionality\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
